1
00:01:30,530 --> 00:01:34,990
[AWAKEN]

2
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:37,940
[Episode 14]

3
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:59,140
[Zhong's Tailor Shop]

4
00:02:12,430 --> 00:02:14,560
Sir, looking to get some clothes made?

5
00:02:18,470 --> 00:02:19,870
I'm looking for someone.

6
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,130
Who are you looking for?

7
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,320
Have you seen this Japanese man?

8
00:02:54,310 --> 00:02:55,110
No, I haven't.

9
00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:00,860
Tell me what the Hurricane Team's
recent operation is.

10
00:03:01,430 --> 00:03:02,310
I don't know.

11
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:04,840
I don't participate in operations.

12
00:03:07,850 --> 00:03:09,510
Then what are you in charge of?

13
00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:10,850
Making clothes.

14
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,150
Don't lie to me.

15
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:22,040
This is the key to your shop.

16
00:03:26,470 --> 00:03:28,400
This is the key to your drawer.

17
00:03:33,310 --> 00:03:34,630
I guess this one...

18
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:38,150
should be your house key.

19
00:03:44,210 --> 00:03:45,970
You have a mother at home

20
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,710
and a five-year-old child.

21
00:03:47,710 --> 00:03:50,120
You live at No. 8, Lane 125, Xiafei Road.

22
00:03:52,090 --> 00:03:53,620
I didn't send anyone there.

23
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,560
I was afraid of scaring them.

24
00:03:56,910 --> 00:03:59,150
But if you keep refusing to cooperate,

25
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:01,690
you'll put me in a difficult position.

26
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:04,260
They don't know anything.

27
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:07,150
Tell me what you know,

28
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:10,220
and I won't make things difficult

29
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:12,390
for you and your family.

30
00:04:26,300 --> 00:04:29,100
Captain Tao called yesterday,

31
00:04:29,130 --> 00:04:30,860
asking me to make some clothes.

32
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,360
What clothes?

33
00:04:35,190 --> 00:04:36,850
Two Japanese soldiers' uniforms

34
00:04:36,850 --> 00:04:38,310
and an officer's uniform.

35
00:04:40,070 --> 00:04:41,159
What is it for?

36
00:04:41,870 --> 00:04:42,700
I don't know.

37
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,040
Where are the clothes?

38
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,750
They've been sent to Lane Zhuzuo.

39
00:04:46,750 --> 00:04:48,920
There should be a station nearby.

40
00:04:50,510 --> 00:04:51,360
Good.

41
00:04:53,870 --> 00:04:55,530
Before we make some progress,

42
00:04:55,830 --> 00:04:57,830
I'm afraid you'll have to stay here.

43
00:05:04,620 --> 00:05:06,750
Go to Lane Zhuzuo and check things out.

44
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:08,640
I'll go there later with our men.

45
00:05:08,780 --> 00:05:09,510
Got it.

46
00:05:16,380 --> 00:05:17,070
Come on in.

47
00:05:23,050 --> 00:05:24,650
We plan to get you out of here.

48
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:25,920
When?

49
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:27,160
Tonight.

50
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:57,120
No. 28, Lane Zhuzuo.

51
00:05:57,430 --> 00:05:59,290
We're not sure if Ishida is there,

52
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:01,720
but according to their food orders,

53
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,890
there are at least 5 people.

54
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,130
Section Chief Zhao.

55
00:06:15,630 --> 00:06:17,090
Getting off work so early?

56
00:06:17,310 --> 00:06:19,000
It's not early. Just on time.

57
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,880
You were never around
when I looked for you.

58
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,160
I know about your request.

59
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,870
I've already had someone on it.

60
00:06:24,870 --> 00:06:26,190
I have an urgent operation today.

61
00:06:26,190 --> 00:06:27,160
I need your backup.

62
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:27,890
Come with me.

63
00:06:28,070 --> 00:06:30,330
I can't be of much help with the missions.

64
00:06:32,310 --> 00:06:34,720
What's the point
of going to the dance hall every day?

65
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,800
I know your Japanese is good.

66
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,330
It will come in handy today.

67
00:06:37,670 --> 00:06:38,290
Get in.

68
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:11,020
Zhao Qian can't go pick her up.

69
00:07:13,270 --> 00:07:14,040
You go.

70
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:14,920
Okay.

71
00:07:14,950 --> 00:07:15,920
Take his car.

72
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,200
What about the NBIS?

73
00:07:19,200 --> 00:07:20,260
Who will tail them?

74
00:07:32,250 --> 00:07:33,380
What's the mission?

75
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,070
Find Ishida.

76
00:07:35,630 --> 00:07:36,690
Have you found him?

77
00:07:37,870 --> 00:07:38,600
I'm not sure.

78
00:07:39,860 --> 00:07:42,810
I hope you can bring me some good luck.

79
00:07:44,250 --> 00:07:45,870
Captain Du, you're capable enough.

80
00:07:45,870 --> 00:07:48,000
Captain Cang is the one who needs luck.

81
00:07:50,159 --> 00:07:52,020
What were your plans for tonight?

82
00:07:52,300 --> 00:07:55,430
Just some social engagements.
It's nothing important.

83
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:29,870
Why did you kill him?

84
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:34,260
You had to ruin my chance
to earn some credit?

85
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:35,210
Captain Tao said

86
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,370
he belongs to us.

87
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:38,120
Alive or dead, he belongs to us!

88
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:40,080
Since Ishida was so important,

89
00:09:40,750 --> 00:09:42,880
you should have kept a close eye on him!

90
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:45,390
Where did Captain Tao go?

91
00:09:45,390 --> 00:09:47,240
I... I don't know!

92
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:03,120
They are all dead.

93
00:10:04,510 --> 00:10:06,630
No one will know you told me.

94
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:08,480
Tell me.

95
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:11,200
Where did Captain Tao go?

96
00:10:15,910 --> 00:10:17,790
You have used up all my patience!

97
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:18,670
Tell me!

98
00:10:19,030 --> 00:10:21,000
Where did they go with the clothes?

99
00:10:23,860 --> 00:10:24,830
Fumin Hospital.

100
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:27,200
They went to Fumin Hospital!

101
00:10:31,670 --> 00:10:32,600
Fumin Hospital.

102
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:19,670
We are from the Plum Blossom Agency.

103
00:11:19,670 --> 00:11:21,270
We're here to pick up a patient.

104
00:11:21,270 --> 00:11:22,200
Did you hear me?

105
00:11:22,220 --> 00:11:22,980
Step aside!

106
00:11:31,710 --> 00:11:32,770
What are you doing?

107
00:11:32,870 --> 00:11:33,870
Get out of the way!

108
00:11:45,190 --> 00:11:46,030
You keep watch here.

109
00:11:46,030 --> 00:11:46,750
I'll go ask.

110
00:11:53,910 --> 00:11:54,550
Hello?

111
00:11:55,750 --> 00:11:56,480
What?

112
00:11:57,400 --> 00:11:59,000
The Plum Blossom Agency
sent people to take her?

113
00:11:59,000 --> 00:11:59,800
Why don't I...

114
00:12:01,510 --> 00:12:02,510
I'll go verify it.

115
00:12:02,870 --> 00:12:04,930
Pay attention to who they are taking.

116
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,200
We're here.

117
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,100
That's all. You can go.

118
00:12:20,390 --> 00:12:21,000
Okay.

119
00:12:33,250 --> 00:12:34,440
Come with us.

120
00:12:36,550 --> 00:12:37,630
Come with us.

121
00:12:44,750 --> 00:12:45,270
Hello?

122
00:12:45,550 --> 00:12:47,830
The Plum Blossom Agency
didn't send anyone at all!

123
00:12:47,830 --> 00:12:49,310
Stall them! I'll be right there!

124
00:12:49,310 --> 00:12:50,040
Understood!

125
00:12:53,230 --> 00:12:54,890
Something's wrong! Let's go!

126
00:12:58,600 --> 00:13:00,260
Everyone, to Fumin Hospital!

127
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:25,200
Excuse me, officer.

128
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:26,500
Which room is this patient in?

129
00:13:26,500 --> 00:13:27,630
We need to register.

130
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:29,270
Bastard!

131
00:13:29,550 --> 00:13:31,790
Does the Plum Blossom Agency need
to report to you when taking someone?

132
00:13:31,790 --> 00:13:32,470
Move!

133
00:13:39,790 --> 00:13:40,360
Let's go!

134
00:13:41,700 --> 00:13:42,270
Go!

135
00:14:11,930 --> 00:14:12,750
That's the car!

136
00:14:12,750 --> 00:14:13,880
Turn around, hurry!

137
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:53,150
Watch out!

138
00:15:51,150 --> 00:15:51,960
Captain Du,

139
00:15:52,670 --> 00:15:55,070
my good luck
can't make up for your bad luck.

140
00:16:03,730 --> 00:16:04,420
Captain.

141
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,930
You... You're injured?

142
00:16:07,270 --> 00:16:08,570
How did you end up like this?

143
00:16:08,570 --> 00:16:10,000
It was my fault that Captain Du

144
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:11,060
suffered a defeat.

145
00:16:11,870 --> 00:16:13,330
Thanks for your hard work.

146
00:16:13,390 --> 00:16:15,990
I just had them check
which patient is missing.

147
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:17,530
No need to check.

148
00:16:18,830 --> 00:16:20,160
They want Ou Yang.

149
00:16:26,790 --> 00:16:27,720
Don't be afraid.

150
00:16:28,550 --> 00:16:29,810
We are here to save you.

151
00:16:31,350 --> 00:16:32,480
We are not Japanese.

152
00:16:33,330 --> 00:16:34,930
We are the Nationalist Army.

153
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:37,910
Your real name is Ou Yang,

154
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:40,490
and you are Hoshino's student, right?

155
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:43,820
We will send you to Chongqing.

156
00:16:44,550 --> 00:16:46,950
You will get good medical treatment there.

157
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:48,670
We hope you can cooperate with us

158
00:16:48,670 --> 00:16:50,270
to uncover Project Slumber.

159
00:17:00,790 --> 00:17:02,480
Diana has made a new plan.

160
00:17:02,670 --> 00:17:05,349
We will wait for the NBIS to make a move
before we do.

161
00:17:05,349 --> 00:17:06,480
You will disguise yourself as Ou Yang

162
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:07,569
and leave with the NBIS

163
00:17:07,569 --> 00:17:09,369
to draw No. 76's attention away.

164
00:17:09,440 --> 00:17:13,040
Leifeng Pagoda will take the opportunity
to help Ou Yang escape.

165
00:17:17,480 --> 00:17:18,240
How is it?

166
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:19,109
It's okay.

167
00:17:19,849 --> 00:17:21,510
Leave wearing these clothes.

168
00:17:21,859 --> 00:17:23,660
Someone will meet you in a while.

169
00:17:23,790 --> 00:17:24,849
Am I leaving alone?

170
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:27,310
Someone will take you away in my place.

171
00:17:27,310 --> 00:17:28,480
He is called Uncle Hai.

172
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:29,340
Remember this.

173
00:17:29,550 --> 00:17:30,750
If you get separated,

174
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:32,960
or if anything unexpected happens,

175
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:35,270
a car will pick you up
at the hospital entrance.

176
00:17:35,270 --> 00:17:37,160
The license plate is 0809.

177
00:17:38,900 --> 00:17:39,760
What about you?

178
00:17:40,110 --> 00:17:41,830
My mission is to get you out.

179
00:17:53,350 --> 00:17:54,750
I'm Uncle Hai. Follow me.

180
00:17:59,160 --> 00:17:59,830
Get in.

181
00:18:27,510 --> 00:18:29,570
The NBIS's plan was really thorough.

182
00:18:29,910 --> 00:18:30,570
Captain Du.

183
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:32,880
Besides the patient in Room 203,

184
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:34,740
another patient is also missing.

185
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:36,480
Who?

186
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:37,790
Liu Xia.

187
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:40,720
Liu Xia?

188
00:18:44,550 --> 00:18:46,270
Liu Xia is also from the NBIS?

189
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:51,090
To get to Chongqing,

190
00:18:52,400 --> 00:18:54,130
it will take a long time, right?

191
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:57,880
There are safe places to stay
along the way.

192
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:02,510
My home is just ahead.

193
00:19:05,580 --> 00:19:07,250
Ever since they arrested me,

194
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:10,930
I haven't been back for a long time.

195
00:19:13,070 --> 00:19:14,870
Can you let me go home for a visit?

196
00:19:22,460 --> 00:19:25,060
I'll send someone
to pick up whatever you need.

197
00:19:29,720 --> 00:19:30,790
Take this ship and leave Shanghai.

198
00:19:30,790 --> 00:19:32,420
Someone will meet her at the next stop.

199
00:19:32,420 --> 00:19:33,060
Okay.

200
00:19:39,360 --> 00:19:41,490
Please thank Su Causeway on my behalf.

201
00:19:41,830 --> 00:19:43,230
That's not her real name.

202
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:45,310
I know.

203
00:19:47,510 --> 00:19:48,440
Have a safe trip.

204
00:19:49,110 --> 00:19:49,790
Goodbye.

205
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:50,570
Goodbye.

206
00:19:59,000 --> 00:19:59,640
Take care.

207
00:20:00,590 --> 00:20:01,200
Take care.

208
00:20:26,750 --> 00:20:27,590
I'm sorry.

209
00:20:28,440 --> 00:20:30,110
I almost got you killed today.

210
00:20:30,750 --> 00:20:31,440
It's nothing.

211
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:33,100
I'll buy you a drink next time.

212
00:20:34,470 --> 00:20:36,670
I'm going back to catch up on some sleep.

213
00:22:01,030 --> 00:22:02,690
Zhao Qian can't go pick her up.

214
00:22:05,030 --> 00:22:05,680
You go.

215
00:22:05,960 --> 00:22:06,550
Okay.

216
00:22:06,670 --> 00:22:07,590
Take his car.

217
00:22:09,830 --> 00:22:10,920
What about the NBIS?

218
00:22:10,920 --> 00:22:11,980
Who will tail them?

219
00:22:46,830 --> 00:22:47,680
Thank you.

220
00:22:48,540 --> 00:22:49,200
Have a seat.

221
00:22:57,960 --> 00:22:58,830
Notify them

222
00:22:59,030 --> 00:23:00,230
to bring Ishida over.

223
00:23:00,790 --> 00:23:01,350
Okay.

224
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:19,890
Have some water.

225
00:23:20,510 --> 00:23:21,350
Ms. Jinbao.

226
00:23:23,780 --> 00:23:24,710
Long time no see.

227
00:23:30,920 --> 00:23:31,780
I didn't expect

228
00:23:33,070 --> 00:23:35,530
to see you again
under these circumstances.

229
00:23:37,550 --> 00:23:39,880
And I didn't expect you
to be from the NBIS.

230
00:23:41,750 --> 00:23:43,410
Miss Shen, you came prepared.

231
00:23:44,350 --> 00:23:45,160
It seems

232
00:23:45,880 --> 00:23:46,880
you knew all along

233
00:23:47,680 --> 00:23:49,410
that we would go rescue Ou Yang.

234
00:23:51,240 --> 00:23:52,900
Have you read Tagore's poems?

235
00:23:54,960 --> 00:23:55,960
I don't read much.

236
00:23:58,790 --> 00:24:00,450
There's a quote I really like.

237
00:24:03,440 --> 00:24:04,310
"Once

238
00:24:06,160 --> 00:24:08,440
we dreamt that we were strangers.

239
00:24:10,550 --> 00:24:11,720
We wake up

240
00:24:13,310 --> 00:24:15,680
to find that we were dear to each other."

241
00:24:19,450 --> 00:24:21,380
Miss Shen, you're a poetic person.

242
00:24:22,070 --> 00:24:23,200
I'm more practical.

243
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:25,400
I just want to know

244
00:24:26,210 --> 00:24:28,580
who leaked our action plan.

245
00:24:29,080 --> 00:24:30,540
Didn't I already tell you?

246
00:24:33,590 --> 00:24:35,200
We were originally one.

247
00:24:39,030 --> 00:24:40,960
Yan'an has people from Chongqing.

248
00:24:41,550 --> 00:24:44,280
How could Chongqing
not have people from Yan'an?

249
00:24:45,350 --> 00:24:46,030
Is that so?

250
00:24:48,070 --> 00:24:49,070
I thought

251
00:24:50,590 --> 00:24:52,320
it was Chen Kailai who told you.

252
00:24:57,440 --> 00:24:59,310
I really hope to see him again.

253
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:02,880
I wonder if he blames me for leaving

254
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:04,740
without saying goodbye that day.

255
00:25:07,070 --> 00:25:09,200
Since we are one, as you said,

256
00:25:10,550 --> 00:25:12,110
having Ou Yang in your hands

257
00:25:12,320 --> 00:25:14,270
is the same as having her in ours.

258
00:25:22,970 --> 00:25:25,100
I don't want to threaten you with a gun.

259
00:25:25,670 --> 00:25:26,930
That won't work on you.

260
00:25:28,090 --> 00:25:29,850
I just want to reason with you.

261
00:25:31,750 --> 00:25:33,640
Ou Yang will be safer in our hands.

262
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:36,540
Since we are "dear to each other,"

263
00:25:36,750 --> 00:25:38,160
why don't you hand her over

264
00:25:38,160 --> 00:25:39,200
to me?

265
00:25:40,920 --> 00:25:42,440
I don't know where she is.

266
00:25:43,040 --> 00:25:44,300
How can I hand her over?

267
00:25:47,270 --> 00:25:48,110
Hand her over,

268
00:25:49,680 --> 00:25:50,740
and I'll let you go.

269
00:25:55,160 --> 00:25:56,590
Looks like I can't leave.

270
00:26:01,210 --> 00:26:03,140
Chen Kailai thought you were dead.

271
00:26:04,070 --> 00:26:05,350
He was heartbroken.

272
00:26:06,770 --> 00:26:08,620
I hope when I go home today,

273
00:26:10,090 --> 00:26:12,750
I can bring him the news
that you're still alive.

274
00:26:14,310 --> 00:26:15,400
Even if you kill me,

275
00:26:16,590 --> 00:26:17,990
I don't know where she is.

276
00:26:20,590 --> 00:26:21,920
What about Chen Kailai?

277
00:26:24,110 --> 00:26:25,310
He's innocent.

278
00:26:31,550 --> 00:26:32,950
Are you going to kill him?

279
00:26:41,470 --> 00:26:42,840
That depends on you.

280
00:26:46,270 --> 00:26:48,670
You're different
from the rest of the NBIS.

281
00:26:50,030 --> 00:26:51,200
Not really.

282
00:26:52,270 --> 00:26:53,710
Tell me where Ou Yang is,

283
00:26:54,590 --> 00:26:56,520
and Chen Kailai will keep his life.

284
00:26:58,240 --> 00:27:00,310
We both love this country.

285
00:27:03,160 --> 00:27:04,420
He will understand me.

286
00:27:06,390 --> 00:27:07,790
You're really ruthless.

287
00:27:08,750 --> 00:27:09,550
I believe

288
00:27:10,730 --> 00:27:13,330
you won't kill someone
who loves this country.

289
00:27:26,860 --> 00:27:28,530
Sir, what can I do for you?

290
00:27:29,030 --> 00:27:30,070
I have an emergency.

291
00:27:30,070 --> 00:27:31,680
I'd like to borrow your telephone.

292
00:27:31,680 --> 00:27:32,430
Well...

293
00:27:33,680 --> 00:27:34,410
I'll pay you.

294
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:39,720
Hello?

295
00:27:40,420 --> 00:27:41,420
How is Ishida?

296
00:27:41,510 --> 00:27:42,640
Everything is fine.

297
00:27:42,960 --> 00:27:43,880
Bring him immediately to

298
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:45,510
berth 5 at the South Bank Pier.

299
00:27:45,510 --> 00:27:46,030
Okay.

300
00:27:47,200 --> 00:27:48,400
Be careful on the way.

301
00:27:49,050 --> 00:27:49,700
Got it.

302
00:28:04,720 --> 00:28:06,070
They've been busy all night.

303
00:28:06,070 --> 00:28:07,270
Go buy them some food.

304
00:28:15,400 --> 00:28:16,000
Hello.

305
00:28:16,230 --> 00:28:19,000
Boss, Tao Dachun
is at the South Bank Pier.

306
00:28:20,380 --> 00:28:21,010
Got it.

307
00:28:24,070 --> 00:28:25,130
Someone's coming.

308
00:28:25,810 --> 00:28:27,140
What are you doing here?

309
00:28:27,240 --> 00:28:29,030
Mr. Tao asked me to deliver breakfast.

310
00:28:29,030 --> 00:28:30,030
Should I take it up to the ship,

311
00:28:30,030 --> 00:28:30,960
or just give it to you?

312
00:28:30,960 --> 00:28:32,310
Wait. Let me check.

313
00:28:32,470 --> 00:28:33,160
Let me see.

314
00:28:36,200 --> 00:28:37,260
There's more here.

315
00:28:38,940 --> 00:28:39,670
Give it to us.

316
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:40,470
Don't move.

317
00:28:40,470 --> 00:28:41,950
Stay quiet and move.

318
00:29:10,890 --> 00:29:14,480
These rude men won't be as polite as I am.

319
00:29:15,030 --> 00:29:16,030
I can tell

320
00:29:17,000 --> 00:29:18,730
that you truly mean well for me.

321
00:29:21,480 --> 00:29:23,680
But I really don't know where Ou Yang is.

322
00:29:41,800 --> 00:29:44,030
Inspector Su, you dared to come in alone.

323
00:29:44,030 --> 00:29:45,690
You really have some courage.

324
00:29:54,900 --> 00:29:56,700
I've got men all around outside.

325
00:29:56,920 --> 00:29:57,960
Holding that gun

326
00:29:58,280 --> 00:29:59,610
is really unnecessary.

327
00:30:00,350 --> 00:30:02,080
That makes things even easier.

328
00:30:02,790 --> 00:30:04,000
My life is worthless,

329
00:30:04,600 --> 00:30:06,060
but they care about yours.

330
00:30:10,280 --> 00:30:13,200
Mr. Dai didn't carefully cultivate
the God of Wealth

331
00:30:13,200 --> 00:30:14,930
just to trade her life for mine.

332
00:30:17,920 --> 00:30:19,850
Who told you I was the God of Wealth?

333
00:30:22,270 --> 00:30:25,200
When I first arrived in Shanghai,
I received instructions

334
00:30:25,200 --> 00:30:26,860
to assist you when necessary.

335
00:30:27,990 --> 00:30:29,520
Even if you work for Mr. Dai,

336
00:30:29,880 --> 00:30:31,880
you couldn't have found this place.

337
00:30:40,680 --> 00:30:41,960
I followed you here.

338
00:30:45,240 --> 00:30:46,030
Followed me?

339
00:30:51,270 --> 00:30:54,120
When you disguised yourselves as Japanese
and entered Fumin Hospital,

340
00:30:54,120 --> 00:30:55,640
No. 76 got the news.

341
00:30:57,200 --> 00:30:58,400
To save you,

342
00:30:58,400 --> 00:31:00,860
I rushed to Fumin Hospital
as fast as I could.

343
00:31:04,950 --> 00:31:07,880
And I happened to see you helping

344
00:31:07,900 --> 00:31:10,160
Tao Dachun's car shake off Du Huangqiao.

345
00:31:13,160 --> 00:31:14,490
Did I need you to save me?

346
00:31:15,480 --> 00:31:16,230
Without you,

347
00:31:16,830 --> 00:31:18,960
we could have still retreated safely.

348
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:23,400
But there are some things

349
00:31:23,700 --> 00:31:24,760
you don't know yet.

350
00:31:25,960 --> 00:31:27,240
Du Huangqiao already knows

351
00:31:27,240 --> 00:31:29,770
the stronghold
where you are holding Ishida.

352
00:31:29,830 --> 00:31:32,430
If Tao Dachun makes contact with them,

353
00:31:32,680 --> 00:31:35,610
Du Huangqiao will soon follow the trail
and find you.

354
00:31:38,470 --> 00:31:40,070
If it weren't for saving you,

355
00:31:40,680 --> 00:31:42,410
I wouldn't have blown my cover.

356
00:31:44,830 --> 00:31:46,640
Sorry to the two guys outside.

357
00:31:47,270 --> 00:31:50,070
The more people who see this,
the greater the risk.

358
00:31:56,000 --> 00:31:57,110
But as far as I know,

359
00:31:58,360 --> 00:32:00,890
it was you
who saved Hoshino at the racecourse

360
00:32:01,790 --> 00:32:03,160
and killed our men.

361
00:32:04,680 --> 00:32:06,480
I did it for Project Slumber.

362
00:32:11,720 --> 00:32:14,050
Your operation gave me this opportunity.

363
00:32:16,030 --> 00:32:17,590
Otherwise, who do you think

364
00:32:18,350 --> 00:32:19,750
gave you Ishida's files?

365
00:32:32,310 --> 00:32:33,200
Time to go.

366
00:32:40,810 --> 00:32:42,760
I'm taking her with me.

367
00:32:45,030 --> 00:32:46,070
She is a Communist,

368
00:32:46,070 --> 00:32:46,920
not Ou Yang.

369
00:32:47,350 --> 00:32:49,190
Ou Yang was taken by the Communists.

370
00:32:49,190 --> 00:32:50,670
Only she knows her whereabouts.

371
00:32:50,670 --> 00:32:52,420
When she pretended to be Ou Yang
and tricked you,

372
00:32:52,420 --> 00:32:54,350
she never planned to go back alive.

373
00:32:54,480 --> 00:32:57,010
Why would she tell you
Ou Yang's whereabouts?

374
00:32:58,120 --> 00:32:59,190
Then I'll kill her.

375
00:33:00,550 --> 00:33:02,240
She knows our identities now.

376
00:33:02,480 --> 00:33:03,880
We can't leave her alive.

377
00:33:06,070 --> 00:33:08,930
I never expected to die
at the hands of my own people.

378
00:33:41,640 --> 00:33:42,720
They just left.

379
00:33:44,030 --> 00:33:44,720
Captain,

380
00:33:45,290 --> 00:33:46,770
did someone tip them off?

381
00:33:51,220 --> 00:33:52,430
The scent of women?

382
00:33:53,880 --> 00:33:54,750
Take care.

383
00:34:01,920 --> 00:34:03,120
Where is Chen Kailai?

384
00:34:17,400 --> 00:34:20,130
Has he contacted anyone else
these past few days?

385
00:34:22,800 --> 00:34:24,800
Only Mr. Zhao came to pick up photos.

386
00:34:39,969 --> 00:34:41,260
[Phone Booth]

387
00:34:41,080 --> 00:34:42,070
Where are you?

388
00:34:42,880 --> 00:34:44,480
Du Huangqiao found our ship.

389
00:34:45,030 --> 00:34:46,360
Ishida is already dead.

390
00:34:47,190 --> 00:34:48,630
It was after you notified them

391
00:34:48,630 --> 00:34:50,690
that you brought Du Huangqiao there.

392
00:34:52,070 --> 00:34:53,960
It was someone
Mr. Dai had planted in No. 76

393
00:34:53,960 --> 00:34:55,219
who covered my escape.

394
00:34:56,360 --> 00:34:57,360
Mr. Dai's man?

395
00:34:57,760 --> 00:34:58,440
Who is it?

396
00:34:59,800 --> 00:35:01,550
Someone you'd never expect.

397
00:35:11,190 --> 00:35:12,390
You're finally back.

398
00:35:13,360 --> 00:35:14,440
I have good news

399
00:35:14,710 --> 00:35:15,800
and bad news.

400
00:35:17,190 --> 00:35:19,030
Which one do you want to hear first?

401
00:35:19,030 --> 00:35:20,030
Neither.

402
00:35:22,070 --> 00:35:23,200
What a coincidence.

403
00:35:23,680 --> 00:35:25,200
I want to tell you both.

404
00:35:27,630 --> 00:35:29,030
Then why did you even ask?

405
00:35:32,670 --> 00:35:33,630
Ishida is dead.

406
00:35:38,440 --> 00:35:39,550
Ishida is dead?

407
00:35:47,280 --> 00:35:48,280
You killed him?

408
00:35:48,480 --> 00:35:49,230
It wasn't me.

409
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:51,550
I'll keep my promise to you.

410
00:35:52,320 --> 00:35:53,670
Du Huangqiao found him,

411
00:35:54,030 --> 00:35:55,690
and the Hurricane Team did it.

412
00:35:55,800 --> 00:35:56,800
Ishida saw us,

413
00:35:56,800 --> 00:35:58,260
so he had to be eliminated.

414
00:35:59,760 --> 00:36:01,320
So you guys did it.

415
00:36:05,710 --> 00:36:07,510
Tao Dachun said you betrayed us.

416
00:36:11,550 --> 00:36:12,550
What do you think?

417
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:15,360
You wouldn't work for No. 76.

418
00:36:16,150 --> 00:36:17,070
Then why ask?

419
00:36:25,510 --> 00:36:27,370
Stop dwelling on Ishida's death.

420
00:36:27,550 --> 00:36:28,480
If he were alive,

421
00:36:29,440 --> 00:36:30,840
we'd be the dead ones now.

422
00:36:37,670 --> 00:36:38,880
That's the good news.

423
00:36:40,360 --> 00:36:41,490
Now for the bad news.

424
00:36:42,480 --> 00:36:44,480
How is that good news?

425
00:36:45,230 --> 00:36:46,960
Not being exposed is good news.

426
00:36:56,320 --> 00:36:57,670
I saw Shen Kexi.

427
00:37:07,800 --> 00:37:08,550
Where is she?

428
00:37:10,420 --> 00:37:11,620
How are her injuries?

429
00:37:12,670 --> 00:37:13,930
She's perfectly fine.

430
00:37:14,960 --> 00:37:17,360
She also went to the asylum
to save someone,

431
00:37:17,980 --> 00:37:20,840
and she knew about
our operation there beforehand.

432
00:37:23,590 --> 00:37:24,190
Tell me,

433
00:37:26,030 --> 00:37:27,560
who could have leaked that?

434
00:37:30,590 --> 00:37:33,050
Just now you suspected me
of being a traitor.

435
00:37:33,920 --> 00:37:36,000
Now you suspect I'm a Communist?

436
00:37:36,960 --> 00:37:39,220
You'd never risk your life for traitors,

437
00:37:39,860 --> 00:37:41,520
but you might do it for a woman.

438
00:37:43,630 --> 00:37:44,550
Ever since I was released,

439
00:37:44,550 --> 00:37:46,550
you've had Xin Xiang lock me up here,

440
00:37:47,360 --> 00:37:49,290
guarding against me at every turn.

441
00:37:49,630 --> 00:37:51,960
Now you're suspecting me of this and that.

442
00:37:52,590 --> 00:37:54,280
Why don't you just tie me up,

443
00:37:54,590 --> 00:37:56,120
just like you did to Ishida?

444
00:37:56,840 --> 00:37:57,770
Why so agitated?

445
00:38:00,860 --> 00:38:02,120
I didn't say it was you.

446
00:38:03,230 --> 00:38:05,280
Stop talking about
fighting and killing all day.

447
00:38:05,280 --> 00:38:06,610
Am I that kind of person?

448
00:38:07,960 --> 00:38:08,590
Jinbao.

449
00:38:10,710 --> 00:38:12,280
If you don't trust me,

450
00:38:13,360 --> 00:38:15,020
let's close the photo studio.

451
00:38:15,230 --> 00:38:17,510
From today on, we go our separate ways.

452
00:38:21,760 --> 00:38:23,070
If this is your scheme,

453
00:38:24,150 --> 00:38:26,080
you're more like an agent than I am.

454
00:38:28,510 --> 00:38:29,910
You should join the NBIS.

455
00:38:30,360 --> 00:38:31,960
Why would I join the NBIS?

456
00:38:34,550 --> 00:38:36,400
I'm just a photographer.

457
00:38:42,440 --> 00:38:44,240
After being involved in so much,

458
00:38:45,280 --> 00:38:46,510
do you still think

459
00:38:46,670 --> 00:38:48,270
you're just a photographer?

460
00:38:48,480 --> 00:38:50,630
I said I didn't want to be involved.

461
00:38:51,280 --> 00:38:53,280
You dragged me into this.

462
00:38:54,590 --> 00:38:56,800
I just wanted to use my camera to record

463
00:38:57,000 --> 00:38:59,060
how you guys are saving this country.

464
00:39:00,030 --> 00:39:01,320
You, my cousin,

465
00:39:02,440 --> 00:39:04,720
my master, and Auntie.

466
00:39:04,760 --> 00:39:06,760
I told you not to mention them again.

467
00:39:10,360 --> 00:39:11,890
Forget about Miss Shen too.

468
00:39:12,840 --> 00:39:13,480
Why?

469
00:39:30,840 --> 00:39:31,760
You didn't...

470
00:39:33,230 --> 00:39:34,430
kill her too, did you?

471
00:39:42,360 --> 00:39:43,160
You wouldn't.

472
00:39:45,070 --> 00:39:46,550
She's not dead, right?

473
00:39:51,950 --> 00:39:54,660
I never expected to die
at the hands of my own people.

474
00:39:54,660 --> 00:39:56,050
Your own people?

475
00:39:57,000 --> 00:39:58,400
In front of the Japanese,

476
00:39:59,030 --> 00:40:00,490
we're all on the same side.

477
00:40:01,840 --> 00:40:03,880
Miss Shen, you're admirable.

478
00:40:07,360 --> 00:40:09,590
Inspector Su,
bearing the stigma of being a traitor,

479
00:40:09,590 --> 00:40:11,250
you went undercover in No. 76.

480
00:40:13,220 --> 00:40:14,480
That's admirable too.

481
00:40:18,190 --> 00:40:21,050
Who would have thought
that the famous God of Wealth

482
00:40:22,560 --> 00:40:24,420
is such a charming dancing queen?

483
00:40:27,400 --> 00:40:28,480
Don't flatter me.

484
00:40:28,960 --> 00:40:30,030
I don't buy it.

485
00:40:33,880 --> 00:40:34,960
The three of us—

486
00:40:35,960 --> 00:40:38,560
one is mingling
in the dance halls of Shanghai,

487
00:40:38,940 --> 00:40:41,740
one is posing as a traitor in No. 76,

488
00:40:42,960 --> 00:40:43,960
and the other

489
00:40:44,590 --> 00:40:46,190
is about to die at your hands.

490
00:40:53,400 --> 00:40:54,860
I've said all I have to say.

491
00:40:55,760 --> 00:40:57,070
Make it quick.

492
00:40:58,110 --> 00:41:01,040
I don't want to fall into
Du Huangqiao's hands again.

493
00:41:04,070 --> 00:41:06,400
When the Japanese are finally driven out,

494
00:41:07,710 --> 00:41:09,800
I just hope one of us survives

495
00:41:10,940 --> 00:41:12,400
to see the snow in Peiping.

496
00:41:18,800 --> 00:41:20,860
No wonder you could fool Chen Kailai.

497
00:41:21,210 --> 00:41:22,500
Even I was moved.

498
00:41:26,200 --> 00:41:27,800
I should have shot you dead.

499
00:41:36,150 --> 00:41:37,150
I didn't kill her.

500
00:41:42,510 --> 00:41:43,510
Then where is she?

501
00:41:47,000 --> 00:41:47,960
Tell me.

502
00:41:49,360 --> 00:41:51,760
She probably left Shanghai
a long time ago.

503
00:41:52,760 --> 00:41:54,110
Stop thinking about her.

504
00:41:54,110 --> 00:41:55,190
She's a Communist.

505
00:41:55,480 --> 00:41:57,670
She would drag you down sooner or later.

506
00:41:57,670 --> 00:41:59,070
And you are from the NBIS.

507
00:42:01,670 --> 00:42:02,710
If I were afraid,

508
00:42:03,260 --> 00:42:05,390
I would have cut ties with you long ago.

509
00:42:08,440 --> 00:42:09,440
No matter what,

510
00:42:10,550 --> 00:42:12,150
as long as everyone is alive,

511
00:42:12,280 --> 00:42:13,280
it's a good thing.

512
00:42:19,550 --> 00:42:21,280
Then take a picture of me today.

513
00:42:22,760 --> 00:42:25,220
I don't know how I'm supposed
to report back.

514
00:42:25,930 --> 00:42:26,890
I'm very sad.

515
00:42:28,850 --> 00:42:30,050
My heart is breaking.

516
00:42:33,110 --> 00:42:34,840
Can you capture this mood?

517
00:42:36,920 --> 00:42:38,250
Your heart is breaking?

518
00:42:38,880 --> 00:42:39,990
I don't see it.

519
00:42:42,280 --> 00:42:43,610
I'm good at pretending.

520
00:42:45,590 --> 00:42:46,280
Okay.

521
00:42:47,400 --> 00:42:48,660
Then keep pretending.

522
00:42:53,510 --> 00:42:54,710
Live a long life.

523
00:43:01,630 --> 00:43:03,400
You'll never see Shen Kexi again.
